New MIUI Music App Update China V4.5.0.1 @MIUI_APK

🔄 Change log:
1. You can listen to personalized radio stations and 30 songs every day without logging into your account;
2. Support Tencent King card, listen to songs, download and watch videos, without consuming data;
3. Optimized some login experiences and forced R&D to fix some bugs.


🚫 If you install it in Global ROM, you will not be able to uninstall updates‼️ 

❗️The language is in Chinese and English

